```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "list the face's delegations and whether each stands"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///face.delegation.reads", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.delegation.reads"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.delegation.reads"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.delegation.reads ~ delegations ~ every grant the root signed

`lares intent delegations` lists each delegation the face's root signed: its cid, status, agent, prefix and the revocation that ended it.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ list

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`list` params=`~ every delegation`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/index ~ the face whose intent plane this reads or writes, a whole persona index from 0`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat` params=`who/seat-or-hand key/face-atom ~ signs under the face's own atom key through the store door`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · face-malformed · face-not-held

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`~ an unknown sub-verb, or no sub-verb named`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`face-malformed` params=`~ --face names a whole persona index from 0`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`face-not-held` params=`~ this vessel holds no such face`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ delegations

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`delegations` params=`exit/0 fields/[[delegations]] ~ one line per grant`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares intent delegations

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host door/part spells/[[lares intent delegations]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

